    "n-gs": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "Every frame on this page is this one component. Open its Tweaks to switch state and full / reduced motion.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2190,
      "y": 8424
    },
    "n-ix01": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "TAP A PIECE\nSquare fills focus blue. Dots on empty legal squares, rings on capturable pieces (Nf3 can take e5).\nPop-in 120ms, easeOutCubic (scale 0.3 → 1).\nTap again or elsewhere: fade out 90ms.\nHaptic: selectionClick.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3704
    },
    "n-ix02": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "DRAG\nLift 100ms: scale 1 → 1.1, shadow 2 → 10px blur.\nThe piece rides 0.4 square above the finger so it's never hidden. The origin keeps a 28% ghost.\nThe square under the finger gets a 4px light ring (instant).",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3704
    },
    "n-ix03": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "MOVE — Bc1–g5\nSlide 200ms, Cubic(0.22, 0.9, 0.3, 1).\nA drop from drag slides from the release point instead of the origin.\nClock hands over as the piece lands.\nHaptic: lightImpact.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 3704
    },
    "n-ix04": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "ILLEGAL — Nf3 dropped on f5\nSnap back 150ms (easeOutCubic), then shake ±5 / ±5 / ±3 px over 200ms.\nOrigin square flashes coral: 70ms in, 400ms out.\nHaptic: mediumImpact.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 3704
    },
    "n-ix05": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "LAST MOVE\nFrom- and to-squares keep a soft brass tint until the next move (fades in 120ms).\nSame tint in every board theme, so it never changes meaning.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 3704
    },
    "n-ix06": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CAPTURE — Bxf6\nAttacker slides 200ms. Captured knight fades + shrinks to 0.55 over 190ms, starting 100ms before the attacker lands.\nThe knight joins the tray under your name and +3 appears (150ms fade).",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix07": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CASTLING — targets\nSelecting the king shows a dot on g1 (two-square move) and a dashed brass ring on the h1 rook: dropping the king on its rook castles too.\nf1 is an ordinary king step.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix08": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CASTLING — O-O\nKing e1 → g1 and rook h1 → f1 slide together as one 240ms animation, easeOutCubic.\nOne haptic (lightImpact), one move in the list.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix09": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "EN PASSANT — exd6\nPawn slides diagonally (200ms). The d5 pawn beside it fades + shrinks, same 190ms curve as any capture.\nMove list marks it “e.p.”",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix10": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "PROMOTION PICKER\nPawn reaches b8: board dims to 58%, picker grows from that square (160ms).\nQueen first and largest, pre-highlighted, then rook, bishop, knight, cancel.\nFor Black the picker grows upward from rank 1.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix11": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "PROMOTION — b8=Q#\nPawn shrinks out (120ms), queen grows 0.6 → 1.08 → 1 (200ms, easeOutBack).\nThis promotion is also mate, so the g8 king pulses coral as the queen lands.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix12": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CHECK — …Bxf2+\nKing square pulses once as the bishop lands (0 → 1 → 0.45 → 1 over 360ms), then stays tinted until the check is resolved.\nYour name line reads “In check”.\nHaptic: heavyImpact.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 5284
    },
    "n-ix13": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "STOCKFISH THINKING\nThree dots bob beside the name (1200ms loop, 150ms stagger).\nShown only after 300ms, so instant replies don't flicker.\nStockfish's clock is the running one.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix14": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "ENGINE MOVE — …d6\nExactly the player's move: 200ms slide, same curve, same last-move tint.\nMinimum 400ms think time before it plays.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix15": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "HINT\nBrass arrow draws from piece to target in 360ms (easeOutCubic); the head appears in the last 100ms.\nHint text fades in under the board. Arrow clears on your next move.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix16": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CLOCKS\nUnder 30s: brass (fill when running, digits + outline when idle).\nUnder 10s: coral, breathing 1 → 0.7 opacity once a second.\nColour change is a 200ms tween. Haptic tick at 10s.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix17": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "FLIP BOARD\nBoard rotates 180° over 300ms (easeInOutCubic) while each piece counter-rotates to stay upright. Coordinates swap at the midpoint; the name rows swap with the board.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix18": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "OPTIONS\nMore → sheet slides up 320ms, scrim to 55% in 200ms.\nOffer draw and Resign live here.\nUndo works only in practice mode: in a normal game it shows locked, and the sheet offers to switch practice on.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 6854
    },
    "n-ix19": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 300,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "GAME OVER\nHold 600ms on the final position, then the result sheet slides up (320ms) over a 55% scrim.\nPrimary: Review with AI coach. Secondary: Rematch, Share report card.\nAll 7 endings → right.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8424
    },
    "n-rm01": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "DRAG (reduced)\nNo scale-up. The lift shows through shadow and the origin ghost only.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm02": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "MOVE (reduced)\nNo travel: the piece fades out at c1 and in at g5, together, 150ms.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm03": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "ILLEGAL (reduced)\nNo shake. The piece fades back to f3 (150ms) and the square flashes coral. Haptic still fires.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm04": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CAPTURE (reduced)\nKnight fades out as the bishop fades in, 150ms. No shrink.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm05": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "CASTLING (reduced)\nKing and rook crossfade to their new squares together, 150ms.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm06": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "EN PASSANT (reduced)\nPawn crossfades to d6; the captured pawn fades, 150ms.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm07": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "PROMOTION PICKER (reduced)\nDim and picker fade in (150ms). No grow.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm08": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "maxH": 260,
      "page": "interactions",
      "text": "PROMOTION (reduced)\nPawn → queen crossfade, 150ms. No overshoot.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 9994
    },
    "n-rm09": {
      "fill": "gray",
